<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY 125 RUNS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY 125 RUNS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Zimbabwe by 125 runs in the first match of the Singer World Series one-day (50 overs) cricket tournament on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 263-7 in 50 overs, Zimbabwe 138 all out in 41 overs.</p>
</text>
